OL,3,GNEWSADozens of village homes
OL,4,Arecommended for approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bid to build 60 homes in a rural
OL,7,Fvillage is being recommended for
OL,8,Fapproval by council planners.
OL,10,FThe homes, earmarked on land south of
OL,11,Fthe A52 Main Road in Brailsford,
OL,12,FDerbyshire, comprises two, three and
OL,13,Ffour-bedroomed properties with 30% set
OL,14,Faside for affordable housing.
OL,16,FBut the scheme has prompted a number of
OL,17,Fobjections over traffic congestion,
OL,18,Fdrainage issues and the impact on
OL,19,Fservices such as schools and GP
OL,20,Fsurgeries.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
