OL,3,GNEWSADozens of village homes
OL,4,Arecommended for approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FGina Huffen, planning officer at
OL,7,FDerbyshire Dales District Council,
OL,8,Fsaid: "The proposal provides up to 60
OL,9,Fnew dwellings, making a meaningful
OL,10,Fcontribution towards meeting the
OL,11,Fdistrict's identified housing needs and
OL,12,Fboosting the supply of market and
OL,13,Faffordable housing."
